# Environment variables
# Glob-based so new variants (.env.prod, .env.production, prod.env) are caught
# automatically. The deployment guide has you run `git pull` in the same
# directory as the production .env, so a near-miss filename must not be
# committable.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env

# Secrets / TLS material (the VM will hold certs once HTTPS is enabled)
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets.json
id_rsa
id_rsa.*

# Local agent/editor tooling
.claude/
.cursor/

